79d2-bcf5-49fa-a4c5-47f6d95f2446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=492b6db46e6484f6ff5921911917a1b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/288f44b2/uploads/origins/d36b79d2-bcf5-49fa-a4c5-47f6d95f2446?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fed15b4a732e0b3fb85c85af1a41ef3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is so cute! I love how vibrant your colors are! May I request 3 characters? \n\nChuchu🍓🍦 (11): A cheerful and bright girl! She is an energetic and tomboyish girl.\nRu Yi 🫐🍫 (11): He is a grumpy and quiet boy. A little too serious for a child... He is the youngest of the 3 (by a month.) He is quite competitive despite how he looks. \nBai Ying 🍒🍮(12): He is a kind boy who likes to help others. He is a bit of an airhead but tries to hide it. He is part of the student council and is the oldest of the three. \n\nThey are classmates and close friends! They also hang out after school a lot, either at their houses or at fun places! They also all enjoy eating desserts and playing games. More information can be found in the link. \n\nI will leave the composition to sensei ^^ Sensei can also alter their outfits too! \n\nFeel free to raise the price or cancel if inappropriate. Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/213ap60v7n2o", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}